The problem is that the Compaq Fortran shared libraries are not on your 
Linux machine.  Copying the libraries over should work, but a better 
solution would be to compile with the "-non_shared" flag.

You might also consider getting the Compaq compiler for Linux-Alpha:

http://www5.compaq.com/fortran/linux/

They'll run faster that way.  The Linux compiler is free for enthusiast 
or educational use.

