Hi,

Sound is working fine on my PWS500au  ( Redhat 7.1 kernel  2.4.6 )
The sound modules that I load are :

alias sound-slot-0 sb
options sound dmabuf=1
alias synth0 opl3
options opl3 io=0x388
options sb io=0x220 irq=9 dma=0

See also a (the ) Miata How-To :

http://httpd.chello.nl/~s.vandereijk/miata.html

Succes

